{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":64,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܫܡܹܥ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܩܵܠܝܼ ܟܲܕ ܩܵܒ݂ܠܹܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܛܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܚܲܝܝܼ̈ ܡ̣ܢ ܙܕܘܼܥܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܲܫܝܼ ܠܝܼ ܡ̣ܢ ܒܘܼܨܵܐ ܕܥܵܒ݂ܕܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܫܓ݂ܘܼܫܝܵܐ ܕܦܵܠܚܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܥܵܘܠܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܡܘܼܚܪܸܦ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܠܸܫܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܣܲܝܦܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܬܝܼܚ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܗܹܡܸܙܡܵܢ ܡܲܪܝܼܪܬܵ‌ܐ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܓܹܐܪܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܪܲܦܘܼܝܹܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܣܸܬܵܪܹ̈ܐ ܥܲܠܔ ܬܲܡܝܼܡܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܸܢܫܸܠܬܵܢܹܐ ܟܹܐ ܪܲܦܝܼ ܥܲܠܘܼܗ‌ܝ، ܘܠܹܐ ܙܵܕܥܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܚܲܠܸܢܝܼ ܠܵܗ̇ ܓܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܒܨܒ݂ܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܘܼܡܙܸܡ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܒܘܼܬ ܛܲܫܘܼܝܹܐ ܦܲܚܹ̈ܐ؛","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܡܝܼܪܗܘܿܢ: ”ܡܵܢܝܼ ܒܸܬ ܚܵܙܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ؟“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܬܲܚܡܸܢܝܼ ܥܵܘ̈ܠܹܐ، ܒܹܐܡܵܪܵܐ: ”ܡܛܹܐ ܠܲܢ ܠܬܲܚܡܲܢܬܵ‌ܐ ܨܢܝܼܥܬܵ‌ܐ.“","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܓܵܘܵܐ ܕܐܢܵܫܵܐ ܘܠܸܒܹܗ ܥܲܡܘܼܩܹ̈ܐ ܝܢܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܕܵܪܹܐ ܓܹܐܪܵܐ ܥܲܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܗܵܘܝܼ ܡܲܚܘܵܬܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܡܸܢܫܸܠܬܵܢܹܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܦܵܝܫܝܼ ܬܘܼܪܩܸܠܹܐ، ܒܠܸܫܵܢܵܐ ܕܓܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܚܕܝܼܪܵܐ ܠܕܲܠܩܘܼܒ݂ܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܡܲܫܥܸܫ ܪܹܝܫܵܐ ܟܠܔ ܕܚܵܙܹܐ ܐܸܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܸܬ ܙܵܕܥܝܼ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܐܢܵܫܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܡܲܕܥܝܼ ܦܘܼܠܚܵܢܵܐ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܥܒ݂ܵܕܹܗ ܒܸܬ ܦܲܪܡܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܚܵܕܹܐ ܙܲܕܝܼܩܵܐ ܒܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܘܫܵܩܹܠܔ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ ܒܝܼܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܸܬ ܥܵܒ݂ܕܝܼ ܫܘܼܒ݂ܗܵܪܵܐ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܬܪ̈ܘܼܨܹܐ ܕܠܸܒܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/64.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/65.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/63.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}